('Can a real estate syndication offset my W-2 income?', 'Do not assume the result from a product label. Limited-partner participation generally is restricted but has specified exceptions. Have your CPA review the actual activity and all applicable loss limits; neither a syndication nor direct STR ownership guarantees usable losses.'),
('What do syndications do better than direct ownership?', 'A particular offering may delegate operations or provide broader asset exposure. Confirm the actual portfolio, fees, responsibilities and control; not every syndication diversifies assets or eliminates investor work, and no superior return is established here.'),
